        difficulty: { level: 'High', text: "A chlor-alkali plant is easy to copy, but turning 75% of the chlorine into ECH, CPVC and specialty intermediates needs several linked plants, handling of hazardous chlorine and customer approvals (seven to eight months for chlorotoluene products). ECH from glycerine is a process no one else in India runs." },
